{
    "title": "Word Trails: Search",
    "description": "Looking for a new word search game that will challenge your brain and relax your eyes?\r\n\r\nTry Word Trails: Search, the game that brings a fresh twist to the classic word search puzzle. You can paint the words in any direction: up, down, left, or right. No diagonal words here! \r\n\r\nWord Trails: Search has a minimalistic and soothing design that will make you feel calm and focused. The game has over 10000 levels to explore, from easy to hard. You can also play daily levels and weekly tournaments to earn rewards and compete with other players.\r\n\r\nWord Trails: Search is the perfect game for word lovers who want to have fun and improve their vocabulary. It's designed for adults who want to exercise their brains and improve their IQ. Download it now and enjoy the best word search game ever!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for a new word search game that will challenge your brain and relax your eyes?<br><br>Try Word Trails: Search, the game that brings a fresh twist to the classic word search puzzle. You can paint the words in any direction: up, down, left, or right. No diagonal words here! <br><br>Word Trails: Search has a minimalistic and soothing design that will make you feel calm and focused. The game has over 10000 levels to explore, from easy to hard. You can also play daily levels and weekly tournaments to earn rewards and compete with other players.<br><br>Word Trails: Search is the perfect game for word lovers who want to have fun and improve their vocabulary. It&#39;s designed for adults who want to exercise their brains and improve their IQ. Download it now and enjoy the best word search game ever!",
